From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 06:34:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Rename Indy Institutions to Indy, consolidate all
 Indianapolis content there, and fix content accuracy issues

- Renamed "Indy Institutions" to "Indy" sitewide (nav, footer, ticker, badges, breadcrumbs, titles)
- Made Indy the single hub for all Indianapolis-specific content: linked in the previously
  orphaned "Go for the Wings" (BuffaLouie's Carmel) post, added a new "Four Indianapolis
  Restaurants That Became Institutions" post (St. Elmo, Slippery Noodle Inn, Harry & Izzy's,
  Bluebeard), and surfaced the Top 10 Things To Do and Top 10 Indy Sports Moments lists there
- Rebalanced Top 10 Restaurants and Top 10 Trails to be broad/national instead of
  Indianapolis-heavy, replacing the removed Indianapolis entries with verified real picks
  (Franklin Barbecue, Katz's Deli, Zingerman's, Swan Oyster Depot, Precipice Trail, Kalalau Trail)
- Fixed factual errors: 2005 Colts were 13-0 (not 14-0) when Tony Dungy (not Bill Polian) rested
  starters; corrected the Steve Perry/Journey departure timeline (Kellie Nash died in 2012, well
  after his 1996/1998 exits, not the cause of his 1996 departure); removed a fabricated trail name
  ("Tunnel to Towers Trail") with no real match on Lookout Mountain
- Fixed the Full Archive to actually include all Top 10 lists and the Shopping guide
- Fixed the About page's claim about headline prefixes to match how the site actually works
- Verified Indiana Hoosiers 16-0 CFP championship claim, Slippery Noodle Inn's "oldest bar in
  Indiana" claim, and the BuffaLouie's Carmel address/details are all accurate

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
